I am at the water metro terminal now.
I walk to the entrance.
I tap my new card there.
Immediately, the gate opens.
I walk to the dock.
There is a beautiful boat there.
This is an electric boat.
I board that boat.
It is nice and cool inside the boat.
I sit in a seat near the window.
There are a lot of people on the boat.
After a short while, the boat departs.
This boat is very quiet.
I like this journey very much.
